  m_Name: Phase2_Series
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::STEM.Experiments.Resistance.ResistancePhase
  instruction: 'Step 2: Add resistor R1 in series with R2.

    The ammeter stays
    in series and the voltmeter

    connects in parallel across R1.'
  resultText: 'Measurement: V = {V} V, I = {I} A


    R1 = V / I = {Vn} / {In} ~
    {R} Ohm


    Total resistance: Rtot = R1 + R2 = 100 + 50 = 150 Ohm

    Source
    check: V = I * Rtot = {In} * 150 ~ 5 V'
  requiredTopology: 2
  requiredVoltmeter: 1
  switchStartsClosed: 1
